00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:10.709 align:start position:0%
 
max what do you want for dinner  hello there batman fans issue three of  the caped crusaders adventures on the  fortnite island released  and like usual we're going to break down  everything that happened  in the third installment of the story  highlighting things you may have missed  and the super important things too  i'll be sure to link the playlist if  you've joined this series late my  creator code is adamaru if you fancy  supporting my nonsense  and as always a like goes a long way  towards helping me out  anyway back on point let's break down  issue three of  batman fortnite zero point  two weeks ago we watched batman and  catwoman team up to give selena the vic  roy  and hopefully escape the loop right away  this episode is a special one  look at those dialogue panels almost the  entire issue is written from the  perspective of a person  outside the loop watching batman on the  island  we aren't given details on who they are  i'm going to assume  it's an io employee but keep in mind  this isn't confirmed  just yet we pick up the story as batman  is beating the living hell out of all  the other combatants  and look there's my girl penny the  message reads  into office memo from loop observation  to  psyops subject i'm worried about the  batman  the message is sent by someone whose job  it is to watch  fortnite it'd be like watching twitch 24  hours a day  not a bad job but the thing which is  most interesting is who the memo  is to cyops siteops is a shorthand way  of  saying psychological operations this is  the process of changing people's  behavior to suit those  making the decisions a form of  manipulation  we won't delve into that that's a topic  for another time right now we know  someone is outside the loop  dictating what happens inside the loop  batman in this issue  is totally focused on escape by winning  the game and being the last person  standing  he continues to write notes to himself  on his armor and thanks to that  he makes a weapon to give himself an  unfair advantage  technically batman is using hacks right  now  [Music]  in every issue so far batman has cheated  first teaming with catwoman  and now using hacks to make his weapon  rp batman retains his emotions in  between rounds  and this is key to him being so driven  to win the person watching comments  it feels personal and in the following  panel the io official  asks if the emotional memories can be  wiped  this is followed up by saying that  immobilizing someone's feelings in the  loop  impacts their fighting ability their  skill their edge  noting that they have an agenda for  batman to follow  get this they want batman to escape the  loop but he's doing it too quickly and  may succeed before they're ready for him  batman is unbelievably efficient at  defeating enemies on the island  every storm circle he stays at the  center of it keep on running batman  a new memo pops up loop observation is  now speaking to  acquisitions those are responsible for  finding and recruiting assets  into fortnite and they have a solution  to slow down batman  a new asset joins the fight wielding a  katana and moving like a ninja  batman may have found his equal the  asset  is snake eyes  [Music]  as a brief history lesson snake eyes is  from the gi joe universe  who after saving a princess in peril is  given the name snake eyes and trained to  be a badass ninja  he's the first gaijin in the clan other  versions of his backstory see him  serving in the vietnam war he's a key  bit of law  snake eyes will feel quite at home on  the island because he cannot speak  he was shot in the throat in the  resolute storyline many years ago  remember that he's mute it comes up  later the observer knows how perfectly  matched batman and snake eyes are  perfect attacks are followed by perfect  blocks in a battle which lasts  the entire length of a loop 22 minutes  oh and a quick note that the run of  batman being smashed in the face  continues just like harley quinn last  episode snake eyes hits a headbutt which  would break most people's noses  but not bruce you know why because i'm  batman the fights are stopped by the  storm and every 22 minutes the battle  begins afresh  in a brand new loop something had to  change  batman tries to bring back an old  favorite vehicle do you remember its  name  yeah it's the quad crasher good little  easter egg there snake eyes and batman's  battles become so epic and huge  that all the other characters in game  completely stop fighting  and choose to watch these two titans  fight instead this page is full of  fortnite characters you'll recognize  what's super interesting is the  characters that don't belong to epic  games  in this issue in addition to batman's  snake eyes we can see  a fortnight psycho straight out of  borderlands  and here look at the shadowy outlines a  dual wielding character which looks a  lot like  deadpool a marvel character in a dc  comic book  deadpool was actually based on  deathstroke who will soon be part of  this story too  but the cameo which i'll probably put on  the thumbnail is here  do you recognize this silhouette i'd put  money on this being sama saran from the  metroid series  she never made it into fortnite at least  not yet  but we heard something via the apple vs  epic trial that samus was indeed planned  to join the fortnite world alongside  kratos representing playstation  and master chief representing xbox so  samus would have been there  representing nintendo sadly that was not  to be  but unofficially look she's here stood  next to capcom's street fighters ryu  and chun li there's a really good remote  to go with chun li you should try it  sometime  back to the story here's more law we  know that memories are wiped every  single loop  but emotions carry over over multiple  battles batman and snake eyes have  discovered  another emotion which carries over  respect  the two are now kindled into a bromance  that we haven't seen on the island for a  very long time they even share a moment  where they catch each other's throwables  like total bffs out of nowhere bruce is  blindsided by the oppressor  and to show us the bromance based on  fighting prowess is legit  snake eyes eliminates oppressor brutally  saving batman's life they share a moment  and straight back to fighting one  another  the battle takes the duo to the cliff  tops south of dirty docks  and a single mistake hands victory to  batman  snake eyes loses his footing at the edge  of the cliff  doomed to die from fall damage we've all  been there  but heck no batman catches the arm of  snake eyes preventing his fall  you son of a batman  had enough the person watching  looks like they've hit their face on the  keyboard right now and writes  auras which is quickly deleted from the  conversation  now here's a bombshell of information  remember in issue one when batman tried  to use sign language to talk to ruckus  that failed and also remember snake eyes  is mute  well take a look at this batman and  snake eyes  pause their fight for a moment to speak  to each other in  sign language a frantic email is sent by  the observer to  archives to try and decipher these hand  signals  both of these characters are american so  i'm going to assume they are using asl  american sign language  which means my limited knowledge of  british sign language may be useless  here  so i'm going to assume batman says this  if you do know what these gestures mean  please let me know and i'll pin your  comments below  snake eyes looks to be saying voice but  even the person observing  doesn't know the language they deduce  this sign language is used on multiple  worlds and dimensions  batman kinda looks like he's asking  snake eyes to leave the circle willingly  the panic of the observer now reaches  fever pitch as snake eyes  understands batman's theory and the two  share a bro moment  snake eyes walks into the storm to give  batman the vikroy  this moment is overshadowed by the memo  circulating around io  this time all senior partners are copied  in  things just got serious snake eyes looks  back  as batman shows his respect and  gratitude snake eyes is eliminated  bruce is now the sole survivor at the  center of the final circle  he will break out of the loop in a few  moments  the observer warns of batman's impending  arrival  and wishes those who will face him the  best of luck  batman did it he survived he is now out  of the loop but this adventure  is just about to change escaping the  22-minute loop  was the easy part batman looks up to  hear the first voice he's heard in weeks  don't do anything stupid catwoman is  being held hostage by deathstroke  who proclaims no sudden moves or she's  dead  to be continued in part four of the zero  point storyline  a few things to quickly note back in  issue one and the mysterious figure who  pushed batman into the void  we are now 100 certain it was  deathstroke  deathstroke somehow broke out of the  loop either by winning or maybe  something else we haven't considered yet  but the thing i was wondering all along  was if the island would change when  outside the loop  but judging from this first look the  island is the same  from this point forward batman and the  cast will have use of their voices again  and no longer be controlled by a wipe  every 22 minutes  but we don't know if they have their  memories back already or they'll regain  them over time  or maybe never so many questions about  the observer and how they knew he would  escape the loop here's my back  crazy guess midas rex i think he's the  key here  he broke the loop before so maybe he's  the mastermind at work  i can't wait to find out i'm adam from  playstation grenade here's a bunch of  legends who made this series possible by  using my code adamaru in the store  thank you so much i truly appreciate it  see you next time  [Music]  you

